Orbit is a modified version of Tolaria.

    Tolaria — https://github.com/refactoringhq/tolaria
    Copyright (C) Luca Rossi and the Tolaria contributors
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later

Orbit's editor core — everything under `src/mainview/editor/` — was taken from
Tolaria in 2026 and modified. Individual files carry a comment naming the
Tolaria file they came from and what changed; the ones marked "lifted
unchanged" are verbatim copies. Everything outside that directory (the Bun
services, the RPC layer, the shell UI, the dashboard, the sidecar metadata
store) was written for Orbit.

Notable modifications to the editor core:

  - Wikilinks removed from the block schema; links are relative markdown links.
  - Vault-relative image resolution replaced with paths relative to the file.
  - tldraw whiteboard and audio/video blocks dropped.
  - Vault-scoped services replaced with Orbit's multi-root equivalents.

